  entryReasons:
    earlyDaysReasons:
    - Returning home after primary school.
    - Resident returning with family members.
    - Retrieving a lost toy from the park.
    midDaysReasons:
    - Escaping the high radiation zones.
    - Checking on the status of my classroom.
    - Seeking shelter from the black rain.
    finalDaysReasons:
    - Seeking refuge from the falling ash.
    - Returning to assigned bunk for safety.
    - Fulfilling mandatory youth census.
  invalidEntryReasons:
    earlyDaysReasons:
    - Going to work.
    - Returning home to see a pet that died last year.
    - Buying candy from a store that is boarded up.
    midDaysReasons:
    - Looking for a teacher who moved away in 1988.
    - Meeting a friend at the abandoned quarry.
    - Going to work.
    finalDaysReasons:
    - Going home to have tea with the shadows.
    - I need to go back and find my missing face.
    - To wait for the monsters to finish their dinner.
  entryDialogues:
    lastVerdict: 0
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Hello. My mom said I have to show you this paper.
    - "It\u2019s very loud out there. Is it always going to be this loud?"
    - I found a shiny stone in the dirt. Do you want to see?
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Why is your shadow so much longer than you are, mister?
    - "The playground is empty. The swings move even when there\u2019s no wind."
    - "I can hear the buildings whispering. They\u2019re cold and they want blankets."
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - "I\u2019m playing hide and seek with the sun. I think I won."
    - "My dolls told me it\u2019s time to go into the big sleep."
    - Is it tomorrow yet? Or is today just going to stay forever?
